```text
~ start

if GameState.hide_chase_active
	Hide behind the plant?

	- Yes
		$> GameState.cancel_hide_chase()
		You hide behind the plant...
		You're somehow confident that whatever that thing is won't be able to find you here.
		VINCENT: Are you sure we needed to hide?
		It found you.
		[scene=game_over]
		=> END

	- No
		You need to hurry up...
		=> END

else
	VINCENT: Oh god! (suprised)
	VINCENT: It's a real plant. (Happy)
	PLUM: It looks tastsy... (silly)
	VINCENT: I'll get you something to eat later.
	=> END
```